{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"AppGoat API","version":"1.0.0","summary":"App Store + Google Play data for agents and apps.","description":"Every app and developer in both stores, daily top charts, reviews, change feeds, metric history and keyword\n(search-rank) intelligence.\n\n**Conventions**\n- `{app}` accepts anything that identifies an app: an App Store id (`284882215`, `id284882215`), a Play\n  package (`com.spotify.music`), an Apple bundle id (`com.spotify.client`), a store URL, `apple:<id>` /\n  `play:<id>`, or a name (`spotify` → best match, with a warning in `meta.warnings`). Add `store=apple|play`\n  to disambiguate. `data.linked` is the same app in the other store when we know it.\n- Freshness is automatic: app-scoped reads refresh data older than `max_age` seconds from the store first\n  (1 credit per country fetched, capped at 10). `wait=true` (default) blocks up to ~25 s; on timeout, or with\n  `wait=false`, you get the cached data with `meta.freshness.refreshing: true` and a `job_id` to poll at\n  `GET /v1/jobs/{id}` (free).\n- `country` defaults to `us`; pass a comma list (paid plans) or `all` (Studio).\n- `include=` adds sections, `fields=` keeps only the listed top-level fields, lists page with `cursor`\n  (pass `meta.next_cursor` back unchanged).\n- Every success is `{ data, meta }`; `meta.credits_used` is what the call cost and `meta.credits_remaining`\n  what is left. Errors are `{ error: { code, message, hint, docs } }`: read `hint`, it says what to do next.\n- `x-credits` on each operation documents its price.\n- Watches turn store changes into events: `POST /v1/watches`, then poll `GET /v1/events` or add a webhook\n  (`POST /v1/webhooks`). Watches, events and webhooks are free; only the plan's watched-app and keyword-slot\n  limits apply. `/v1/tracked-keywords` is deprecated: use keyword watches.\n","contact":{"email":"support@appgoat.ai","url":"https://appgoat.ai"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.appgoat.ai/v1"}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Apps"},{"name":"Search & charts"},{"name":"Keywords"},{"name":"Developers"},{"name":"Audits"},{"name":"Watches & events","description":"Watch apps, competitors and keywords; significant changes become events (feed, webhooks, Slack, GitHub, daily email digest)."},{"name":"Webhooks"},{"name":"Connections"},{"name":"Actions"},{"name":"Jobs"},{"name":"Account"}],"paths":{"/apps/{app}":{"get":{"operationId":"getApp","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"Get everything about one app (metadata, ratings, price, markets, linked app in the other store).","description":"Use this first when a user mentions an app. Pass any identifier or a name in `{app}`. Data older than\n`max_age` (default 7 days) is refreshed from the store; an app we never saw is fetched on the spot (if it\nis still being fetched after ~25 s you get HTTP 202 with `data: null` and a `job_id`).\n`include` adds sections: `markets` (every storefront), `iap` (in-app purchases), `versions` (version\nhistory with release notes), `privacy` (App Store privacy labels), `estimates` (modelled downloads /\nrevenue), `charts` (current top-chart positions), `summary` (AI summary, coming soon).\n","x-credits":"1 + 1 per country refreshed from the store (max 10)","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Country"},{"name":"include","in":"query","description":"Comma list of extra sections.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"versions,iap"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/MaxAgeApp"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Wait"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Fields"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The app.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/App"}}}]},"example":{"data":{"store":"apple","app_id":"324684580","bundle_id":"com.spotify.client","title":"Spotify: Music and Podcasts","developer":{"id":"324684583","name":"Spotify"},"rating":4.78,"ratings_count":42668141,"version":"9.1.92","markets":[{"country":"us","available":true,"price":0,"currency":"USD","rating":4.78,"ratings_count":42668141,"version":"9.1.92","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:03:07Z"}],"linked":{"store":"play","app_id":"com.spotify.music","title":"Spotify: Music and Podcasts","icon_url":"https://…","match":"developer"}},"meta":{"credits_used":1,"credits_remaining":9981,"store":"apple","freshness":{"fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:03:07Z","age_seconds":3600,"stale":false,"refreshing":false,"job_id":null},"request_id":"req_123"}}}}},"202":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Fetching"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/reviews":{"get":{"operationId":"listReviews","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"List an app's user reviews, newest first, with filters (rating, version, date, text).","description":"Up to 100 reviews per page (1 credit per page). Combine `rating=1-2` with `since` to find recent\ncomplaints, `q` for full-text search, `version` to see what users say about a release. The latest US\nreviews are refreshed when older than `max_age` (default 1 day). AI tags (`sentiment`, `intent`,\n`severity`, `topic`) are filled for tagged reviews (popular apps first) and null otherwise; filtering by\nthem excludes untagged reviews. `intent=bug,crash&since=…` is the \"what broke in the last release\" query.\n","x-credits":"1 per page + 1 if the US reviews are refreshed","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Country"},{"name":"rating","in":"query","description":"Star rating filter, `1`, `1,2` or a range `1-3`.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"1-2"}},{"name":"version","in":"query","description":"Only reviews written for this app version.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Since"},{"name":"until","in":"query","description":"Only reviews created before this ISO date / datetime.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"q","in":"query","description":"Case-insensitive text search in the title and body.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"crash"}},{"name":"sentiment","in":"query","description":"AI sentiment filter (comma list): positive, neutral, negative.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"negative"}},{"name":"intent","in":"query","description":"AI intent filter (comma list): bug, crash, feature_request, pricing, ux, praise, spam, other.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"bug,crash"}},{"name":"topic","in":"query","description":"AI topic filter (comma list of topic labels, case-insensitive, or topic ids).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/MaxAgeReviews"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Wait"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Limit100"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Fields"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"A page of reviews.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Review"}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/history":{"get":{"operationId":"getAppHistory","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"Get an app's daily metric history (rating, ratings count, installs, star histogram, price).","description":"One row per country and day **on which a value changed** — carry the previous row forward for the days\nin between. Defaults to the last 90 days. Use it to chart growth or spot rating drops.\n","x-credits":"1 + 1 per country refreshed (max 10)","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Country"},{"name":"from","in":"query","description":"Start date (ISO), default 90 days before `to`.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","description":"End date (ISO), default today.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/MaxAgeApp"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Wait"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Metric rows, by country then date.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HistoryPoint"}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/changes":{"get":{"operationId":"listAppChanges","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"List what changed in an app's store listing (version, title, subtitle, screenshots, price, IAP, …).","description":"Typed change feed, newest first: one entry per changed field with `old` and `new` values. Fields include\nversion, release_notes, title, subtitle, description, screenshots, icon, price, iap, iap_range, privacy,\nin_app_events, badges, featured, editors_choice, installs, content_rating, developer. Ideal for competitor\nmonitoring (\"what did X change this month?\").\n","x-credits":"1 + 1 if the US listing is refreshed","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"name":"country","in":"query","description":"Only changes seen in these storefronts (comma list). Default all storefronts.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"field","in":"query","description":"Only these fields (comma list), e.g. `version,title,subtitle`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Since"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/MaxAgeApp"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Wait"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Changes, newest first.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Change"}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/keywords":{"get":{"operationId":"listAppKeywords","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"List the search keywords an app ranks for, best rank first, with popularity and difficulty.","description":"From the latest ranking we hold for each term: our keyword universe (re-ranked weekly, top 50) plus your\nown tracked keywords (`source: tracked`). Use it for ASO audits and to find keyword gaps against a\ncompetitor (call it for both apps and compare).\n","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Country"},{"name":"max_rank","in":"query","description":"Only terms where the app ranks at or above this position.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":500}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":500,"default":100}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Ranked terms.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AppKeyword"}}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/competitors":{"get":{"operationId":"listCompetitors","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"Find an app's competitors (apps ranking for the same keywords plus the store's \"similar apps\").","description":"Scored list, best first. Keyword overlap counts most and is weighted by rank on both sides (sharing a top-10\nterm counts far more than both sitting at #30 for a generic one) and by how specific the other app is\n(apps that rank in many more keyword universes than this one, such as social or video giants, are\ndown-weighted). The store's own similar-apps list (`similar_position`) adds a boost. Apps in an unrelated\ncategory are penalised (adjacent ones such as Health & Fitness and Medical are not), games never match\nnon-games, and apps that only come from the similar list must sit at its very top. Apps by the same\ndeveloper are left out unless `same_developer=true`. An app that isn't in the catalog yet is fetched from\nthe store first (`wait`, as on `getApp`); if the fetch is still running the answer is 202 with an empty list\nand `meta.freshness.job_id`. Feed the result into `getApp` / `listAppChanges` for a competitor digest.\n","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Country"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20}},{"name":"same_developer","in":"query","description":"Include the app's sister apps (flagged `same_developer`). Off by default; they are not competitors.","schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Wait"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Competitors, best first.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Competitor"}}}}]}}}},"202":{"description":"The app is not in the catalog yet and is being fetched; poll `getJob` with `meta.freshness.job_id`, then call again.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","maxItems":0,"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Competitor"}}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/insights":{"get":{"operationId":"getAppInsights","tags":["Apps"],"summary":"Review intelligence for an app - top issues with trends and samples, topics per version, weekly sentiment.","description":"Built from the AI tags on every review (sentiment, intent, severity, topic). `top_issues` are topics carried\nby negative / bug / crash / UX / pricing reviews, with `last_30d` vs `prev_30d` counts and sample reviews;\n`versions` shows what each release changed in sentiment and topics; `sentiment_over_time` is weekly. Use it\nfor \"what do users complain about since v2.3?\" or a reviews → GitHub issues playbook. Reviews not tagged yet\nonly count in the totals (`tagged` < `reviews`, see `meta.warnings`).\n","x-credits":25,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"name":"country","in":"query","description":"One storefront; omit for every storefront we hold reviews for.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"since_days","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":7,"maximum":730,"default":180}},{"name":"versions","in":"query","description":"How many of the latest versions to break down.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":20,"default":6}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Insights.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Insights"}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/apps/{app}/audit":{"post":{"operationId":"runAppAudit","tags":["Audits"],"summary":"Run an App Audit - prioritised ASO actions, metadata rewrites and findings with evidence (first one free).","description":"Refreshes the listing, tags recent reviews, probes ~20 search terms (popularity, difficulty, the app's\nrank, relevance), compares competitors, then writes a prioritised report: `report.actions` (what to do\nfirst, with the evidence and a playbook), `report.metadata` (title / subtitle / keyword-field rewrites\nwithin the character limits) and `report.findings` (deterministic checks with numbers). Every statement\nin the narrative is checked against the measured facts; unsupported ones are dropped.\nTakes 1-3 minutes: with `wait=true` (default) the call blocks up to ~25 s, then answers 202 with the audit\n`id`; poll `GET /v1/audits/{id}` (free). The shareable page is `url` (appgoat.ai/r/..., not indexed).\nAn audit of the same app, country and mode from the last 24 h is returned again for 0 credits unless\n`fresh=true`.\nFailed audits are never charged: one that fails within `wait` costs 0, one that fails after the 202 is\nrefunded automatically (the refund shows on the same request in your usage logs).\n","x-credits":"100 (the first audit of an organization is free)","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/App"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"}],"requestBody":{"required":false,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"country":{"type":"string","default":"us","description":"One storefront."},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["full","lite"],"default":"full","description":"lite = cached data, fewer reviews and keywords (cheaper and faster for us; same price)."},"wait":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"fresh":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Run again even if a recent audit exists."},"free_only":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Only run when it is the free first audit (402 free_audit_used otherwise)."},"white_label":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Studio: the report page carries your branding (brand name, logo, accent colour, CTA, footer; set them in the dashboard under Settings → Report branding) instead of AppGoat's. 402 plan_limit on other plans. Re-using a recent audit applies the branding to it for 0 credits."},"label":{"type":["string","null"],"maxLength":80,"description":"Your label for the audit list, e.g. the client or prospect name."}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The finished audit (or a recent one re-used).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Audit"}}}]}}}},"202":{"description":"Still running; poll `GET /v1/audits/{data.id}`.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Audit"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/search":{"get":{"operationId":"searchApps","tags":["Search & charts"],"summary":"Search the catalog (~5M apps in both stores) by app name or id.","description":"Exact title matches first, then prefix, then substring; most ratings first within each group.","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","required":true,"description":"App name (≥ 2 characters) or exact id.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"photo editor"}},{"name":"store","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"}},{"name":"category","in":"query","description":"Store category name, e.g. `Photo & Video` (App Store) or `PHOTOGRAPHY` (Play).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Fields"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Matching apps.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AppCard"}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"}}}},"/charts":{"get":{"operationId":"getChart","tags":["Search & charts"],"summary":"Get a top chart (free, paid, grossing) for a store, country and category, today or on a past date.","description":"Entries carry `delta` (positions gained since the previous changed capture; negative = dropped) and\n`is_new`; `dropped` lists apps that fell out. Charts are captured daily for every country × category.\n","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"name":"store","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store","default":"apple"}},{"name":"country","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","default":"us"}},{"name":"chart","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["free","paid","grossing"],"default":"free"}},{"name":"category","in":"query","description":"App Store genre id (`36` or `all` = all apps, `6014` = games, …) or Play category (`GAME_PUZZLE`; `APPLICATION` = all apps).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"date","in":"query","description":"The chart as of this date (ISO). Default the latest capture.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":100}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The chart.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Chart"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/keywords":{"get":{"operationId":"getKeywords","tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Get keyword metrics (popularity, difficulty) for up to 25 terms; with include=related, keyword research.","description":"`popularity` is 5–100 (search volume proxy; `popularity_source: apple` = Apple Search Ads data),\n`difficulty` 0–100 (how entrenched the top 10 is), `est_downloads_at_1` the modelled daily downloads of the\n#1 result. Terms not measured in the last 7 days are measured live (≤ 5 per call, 2–5 s each) when\n`wait=true`; others return `pending: true` — call again in a minute.\n`include=related` adds ~10 related terms with their metrics, `suggestions` the store's autocomplete,\n`top_apps` the current top 10 apps. Pass `app=` to get that app's rank and a metadata `relevance` (0–1) for\nevery term — the core of an ASO keyword audit.\n","x-credits":"1 per keyword; 5 per seed with include=related or suggestions","parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","description":"One term. Use `qs` for several.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"photo editor"}},{"name":"qs","in":"query","description":"Comma-separated terms (≤ 25; ≤ 5 with related / suggestions).","schema":{"type":"string","example":"photo editor,collage maker"}},{"name":"store","in":"query","description":"Required unless `app` is given.","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"}},{"name":"country","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","default":"us"}},{"name":"include","in":"query","description":"Comma list: related, suggestions, top_apps.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"app","in":"query","description":"Any app identifier (as in `{app}`); adds `app.rank` and `app.relevance` per term.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Wait"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"One entry per term, in request order.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Keyword"}}}}]},"example":{"data":[{"term":"photo editor","store":"apple","country":"us","popularity":62,"popularity_source":"proxy","difficulty":81,"results_count":200,"est_downloads_at_1":2900,"measured_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:00Z","pending":false,"top_app_ids":["1","2"],"app":{"store":"apple","app_id":"1","rank":14,"relevance":1}}],"meta":{"credits_used":1,"store":"apple"}}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"}}}},"/tracked-keywords":{"get":{"operationId":"listTrackedKeywords","deprecated":true,"tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"List your tracked keywords with their latest top 10.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"store","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"}},{"name":"country","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"q","in":"query","description":"Substring filter on the term.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Tracked keywords.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrackedKeyword"}}}}]}}}}}},"post":{"operationId":"trackKeywords","deprecated":true,"tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Start tracking search ranks for keywords (daily re-rank; idempotent).","description":"Each (term × store × country) uses one keyword slot of your plan; a request that would exceed it tracks nothing and returns 402 plan_limit.","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["store"],"properties":{"term":{"type":"string"},"terms":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":500},"store":{"type":"string","enum":["apple","play","both"]},"countries":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"default":["us"]},"depth":{"type":"integer","description":"How many results to keep per ranking (default 100 Apple / 50 Play)."},"cadenceMinutes":{"type":"integer","description":"Minutes between re-ranks (paid plans can go below 1440)."},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}},"example":{"terms":["photo editor","collage maker"],"store":"both","countries":["us","gb"]}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"One row per tracked (store, country, term).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"integer"},"store":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"},"country":{"type":"string"},"term":{"type":"string"},"created":{"type":"boolean","description":"false = you already tracked it."}}}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"}}}},"/tracked-keywords/{id}":{"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/TrackedKeywordId"}],"get":{"operationId":"getTrackedKeyword","deprecated":true,"tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Get one tracked keyword and its latest top 10.","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"The tracked keyword.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrackedKeyword"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"updateTrackedKeyword","deprecated":true,"tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Change a tracked keyword's depth, cadence or tags.","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"depth":{"type":"integer"},"cadenceMinutes":{"type":"integer"},"tags":{"type":["array","null"],"items":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The updated tracked keyword.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrackedKeyword"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"untrackKeyword","deprecated":true,"tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Stop tracking a keyword (frees its slot).","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/tracked-keywords/{id}/ranks":{"get":{"operationId":"getTrackedKeywordRanks","tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Get a tracked keyword's ranking history (or one app's rank over time with app=).","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/TrackedKeywordId"},{"name":"from","in":"query","description":"Default 90 days ago.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"app","in":"query","description":"Store app id; returns `rank` per point instead of the full id list.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"One point per capture.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"changed":{"type":"boolean"},"rank":{"type":["integer","null"]},"appIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/tracked-keywords/{id}/run":{"post":{"operationId":"runTrackedKeyword","tags":["Keywords"],"summary":"Re-rank a tracked keyword now instead of waiting for the next scheduled run (paid plans).","description":"If it was ranked within the last hour you get that ranking back (200, `queued:false`, free) instead.","x-credits":"1 when queued, 0 when the last hour's ranking is returned","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/TrackedKeywordId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Ranked recently; the latest ranking.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"}}}},"202":{"description":"Queued.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/developers/{dev}":{"get":{"operationId":"getDeveloper","tags":["Developers"],"summary":"Get a developer's profile, all their apps and the same company in the other store.","description":"Name, store page, website and domain, country, app count, total ratings and installs, top category, their apps (most ratings first) and the linked developer in the other store.","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"name":"dev","in":"path","required":true,"description":"`apple:<artist id>`, `play:<developer id>`, a numeric Apple artist id, a Play developer id (often the name), or the website domain (`spotify.com`).","schema":{"type":"string","example":"apple:324684583"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Fields"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The developer.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Developer"}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/audits":{"get":{"operationId":"listAudits","tags":["Audits"],"summary":"List your organization's App Audits, newest first, with status and score (free).","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Audits.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuditSummary"}}}}]}}}}}}},"/audits/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"getAudit","tags":["Audits"],"summary":"Get one App Audit by id - poll this after POST /v1/apps/{app}/audit answered 202 (free).","description":"`status`: queued, running, batched (narrative queued in the batch API), done or failed. `include=facts` adds the measured facts the report is built from.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"aud_3fK9aQ2mXc81LpRt"}},{"name":"include","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["facts"]}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The audit.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Audit"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"updateAudit","tags":["Audits"],"summary":"White-label an App Audit report with your branding (Studio) or switch it back, and set its label (free).","description":"`white_label: true` re-applies your current branding (use it after changing the branding), `false` shows the standard AppGoat report. 402 plan_limit for white_label on plans without white-label audits.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"aud_3fK9aQ2mXc81LpRt"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"white_label":{"type":"boolean"},"label":{"type":["string","null"],"maxLength":80}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The updated audit.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Audit"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/watches":{"get":{"operationId":"listWatches","tags":["Watches & events"],"summary":"List your watches (apps, competitor sets, keyword sets) with usage against your plan's limits.","description":"`meta.usage` has watched apps and keyword slots used vs your plan (`null` limit = unlimited).","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"kind","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WatchKind"}},{"name":"app","in":"query","description":"Only watches that include this app (any `{app}` input).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Watches, newest first.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Watch"}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"}}},"post":{"operationId":"createWatch","tags":["Watches & events"],"summary":"Watch an app, a set of competitors or a set of keywords and get events when something significant changes.","description":"Use this when the user wants to be told about changes (\"tell me when a competitor updates\", \"alert me when my\nrating drops\", \"track my ranks for these keywords\"). Kinds:\n- `app` { app }: new versions, metadata / price changes, featuring, rating drops, review and ratings spikes,\n  chart entries for that app.\n- `competitor_set` { app?, competitors[] }: the same for every app in the set (your own `app` optional).\n- `keyword` { terms[], store, app? }: search-rank moves of `app` for each term (`rank_change`) and new apps in\n  the top N (`keyword_entrant`).\nWatched apps (competitors included) count against `limits.watches`; keyword watches use one keyword slot per\nterm × store × country (`limits.keywords`). Exceeding either returns 402 plan_limit and changes nothing.\nWatched apps are refreshed daily. Events appear at `GET /v1/events` and go to your webhooks.\n","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WatchInput"},"examples":{"app":{"value":{"kind":"app","app":"com.spotify.music","countries":["us","de"]}},"competitors":{"value":{"kind":"competitor_set","app":"284882215","competitors":["389801252","com.zhiliaoapp.musically"],"event_types":["new_version","metadata_change","price_change"]}},"keywords":{"value":{"kind":"keyword","app":"284882215","terms":["photo editor","collage maker"],"store":"apple","countries":["us","gb"],"settings":{"rank_move":3}}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"The watch.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Watch"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/AppNotFound"}}}},"/watches/{id}":{"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WatchId"}],"get":{"operationId":"getWatch","tags":["Watches & events"],"summary":"Get one watch with its apps, keyword slots, thresholds and event types.","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"The watch.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Watch"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"updateWatch","tags":["Watches & events"],"summary":"Change a watch (apps, competitors, terms, countries, event types, thresholds) or pause it with active=false.","description":"Send only what changes; `settings` is merged into the current settings. Growing a watch re-checks your plan's limits (402 plan_limit).","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WatchPatch"},"example":{"competitors":["389801252","com.instagram.android"],"settings":{"significance":0.7}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The updated watch.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Watch"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"deleteWatch","tags":["Watches & events"],"summary":"Stop watching (frees its apps and keyword slots; past events are kept).","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/events":{"get":{"operationId":"listEvents","tags":["Watches & events"],"summary":"List significant changes on your watched apps and keywords, newest first (free; poll this to wake an agent).","description":"Each event has a deterministic one-line `title`, an AI `summary` (or null), a `significance` (0–1) and a typed\n`payload`. Only changes that reach the watch's `settings.significance` become events. To poll, pass\n`since=` the `created_at` of the newest event you already handled (or remember its id and stop paging there).\n","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"type","in":"query","description":"Comma list of event types.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"new_version,rating_drop"}},{"name":"app","in":"query","description":"Only events of this app (any `{app}` input).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/StoreHint"},{"name":"watch","in":"query","description":"Only events of this watch id.","schema":{"type":"integer"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Since"},{"name":"min_significance","in":"query","schema":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Events.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Event"}}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"}}}},"/webhooks":{"get":{"operationId":"listWebhooks","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"List your event endpoints (signed webhooks, Slack incoming webhooks, GitHub repository_dispatch).","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"Endpoints.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEndpoint"}}}}]}}}}}},"post":{"operationId":"createWebhook","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"Send events to a URL, a Slack channel or a GitHub repository (repository_dispatch) as they happen (paid plans).","description":"`kind`:\n- `webhook` (default): POST of the event JSON, signed with `appgoat-signature: t=<unix>,v1=<hex HMAC-SHA256(secret, \"<t>.<raw body>\")>`.\n  The `secret` is returned once, here (rotate with PATCH rotate_secret). Answer 2xx within 10 s.\n- `slack`: `url` is a Slack incoming webhook (https://hooks.slack.com/services/…).\n- `github`: `url` is `owner/repo`, `github_token` a fine-grained token with Contents: read and write on it.\n  Sends `{ event_type: \"appgoat.<type>\", client_payload: <event> }` to start a workflow `on: repository_dispatch`.\nFailed deliveries are retried after 1 min, 5 min, 30 min, 2 h, 6 h, 12 h and 24 h; an endpoint failing 50 times\nin a row is disabled (PATCH active=true re-enables it). Free plan: 402 plan_limit (use GET /v1/events).\n","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["url"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","description":"https URL (webhook), Slack incoming webhook URL (slack) or owner/repo (github)."},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["webhook","slack","github"],"default":"webhook"},"event_types":{"type":["array","null"],"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EventType"},"description":"null = every type."},"description":{"type":["string","null"]},"github_token":{"type":"string","description":"kind github only; never returned."}}},"examples":{"webhook":{"value":{"url":"https://example.com/hooks/appgoat","event_types":["new_version","rating_drop"]}},"github":{"value":{"kind":"github","url":"acme/my-app","github_token":"github_pat_xxx","event_types":["negative_review_spike"]}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"The endpoint, with its signing `secret` (only now).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEndpoint"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"}}}},"/webhooks/{id}":{"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookId"}],"get":{"operationId":"getWebhook","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"Get one event endpoint with its delivery health (failure count, last success / failure).","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"The endpoint.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEndpoint"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"updateWebhook","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"Change an endpoint's URL, event types or description, re-enable it, or rotate its signing secret.","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"event_types":{"type":["array","null"],"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EventType"}},"description":{"type":["string","null"]},"active":{"type":"boolean"},"github_token":{"type":"string"},"rotate_secret":{"type":"boolean","description":"true = new secret, returned in this response only."}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The updated endpoint.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEndpoint"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"deleteWebhook","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"Delete an event endpoint and its delivery log.","x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/webhooks/{id}/test":{"post":{"operationId":"testWebhook","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"Send a `test` event to an endpoint now and see what it answered (status, body, latency).","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The attempt (`ok` false when the endpoint did not answer 2xx).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"delivery_id":{"type":"string"},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"response_status":{"type":["integer","null"]},"response_body":{"type":["string","null"]},"error":{"type":["string","null"]},"duration_ms":{"type":"integer"},"event":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Event"}}}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/webhooks/{id}/deliveries":{"get":{"operationId":"listWebhookDeliveries","tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"List an endpoint's delivery log (every attempt's status, response and next retry), newest first.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookId"},{"name":"status","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["pending","succeeded","failed"]}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deliveries.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookDelivery"}}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/connections":{"get":{"operationId":"listConnections","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"List the connected App Store Connect, Play Console and Apple Ads accounts (ids, linked apps, status; never secrets).","description":"Use the connection `id` in `POST /v1/actions` (or omit it when only one connection fits). `status: invalid`\nmeans the provider rejected the credentials since they were added (`last_error` says why); fix them and call\n`POST /v1/connections/{id}/verify`. `mode: read_only` connections can dry-run actions but not apply them.\n","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"provider","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Provider"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The connections.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Connection"}}}}]}}}}}},"post":{"operationId":"createConnection","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Connect an App Store Connect, Play Console or Apple Ads account (credentials are verified, then stored encrypted).","description":"Credentials per provider (all are verified with one cheap read before anything is stored; they are encrypted\nwith AES-256-GCM and never returned):\n- `asc`: `{ issuer_id, key_id, private_key, vendor_number? }` from App Store Connect → Users and Access →\n  Integrations → App Store Connect API (role App Manager; Sales too for downloads/proceeds sync with\n  `vendor_number` from Payments and Financial Reports). `apps` defaults to every app the key can see.\n- `play_console`: `{ service_account, reports_bucket? }` = the Google Cloud service account JSON key, invited in\n  Play Console → Users and permissions with View app information, Reply to reviews and Edit store listing.\n  `apps` (package names) is required. `reports_bucket` (pubsite_prod_…) enables install stats.\n- `apple_ads`: `{ client_id, team_id, key_id, private_key, ad_account_id? }` from Apple Ads → Account Settings →\n  API for an API user with the API Account Manager role (Apple Ads Platform API; `ad_account_id` is needed when\n  the user can access several ad accounts, the error lists them).\nEach linked app uses one of the plan's connected apps (`limits.connections`; Free 1, read-only). The default\nmode is `actions` (`read_only` on Free).\n","x-credits":0,"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["provider","credentials"],"properties":{"provider":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Provider"},"label":{"type":"string","description":"Your name for it (default: provider + key / account)."},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["actions","read_only"]},"credentials":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"description":"See the description for the fields per provider."},"apps":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Apps to link: App Store ids / bundle ids (asc, apple_ads) or package names (play_console, required)."}}},"example":{"provider":"asc","label":"My ASC key","credentials":{"issuer_id":"57246542-96fe-1a63-e053-0824d011072a","key_id":"2X9R4HXF34","private_key":"-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n…\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----"},"apps":["1234567890"]}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Connected and verified.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Connection"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidCredentials"},"502":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/ProviderError"}}}},"/connections/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"getConnection","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Get one connection (status, linked apps, non-secret account identifiers).","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The connection.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Connection"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"updateConnection","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Rename a connection, switch it between read_only and actions, or change which apps it links.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string"},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["actions","read_only"]},"apps":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Replaces the linked apps (checked against what the credentials can access)."}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Updated.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Connection"}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}},"delete":{"operationId":"deleteConnection","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Disconnect an account; its credentials are erased and open (draft / pending) actions are rejected.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted."},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/connections/{id}/verify":{"post":{"operationId":"verifyConnection","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Re-check a connection's credentials with the provider (after fixing a role or key); lists every app it can access.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Verified; `data.available_apps` are the apps the credentials can see (link more with PATCH).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Connection"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidCredentials"}}}},"/connections/{id}/reviews":{"get":{"operationId":"listConnectionReviews","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Read your own app's reviews from App Store Connect / Play Console with reply status; their ids feed review.reply.","description":"`unanswered=true` keeps reviews without a developer reply (the \"reply to every review\" playbook). Play only\nreturns reviews written or edited in the last 7 days (Google API limit); App Store Connect returns all.\n","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"},{"name":"app","in":"query","required":true,"description":"A linked app (App Store id or package name).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"unanswered","in":"query","schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},{"name":"rating","in":"query","description":"`1`, `1,2` or `1-3`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"country","in":"query","description":"App Store territory filter (ISO alpha-2).","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":100}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"One page of reviews.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProviderReview"}}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"502":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/ProviderError"}}}},"/connections/{id}/listings":{"get":{"operationId":"getConnectionListing","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Read your app's current listing text for one locale and which fields can be edited right now.","description":"App Store name/subtitle/description/keywords/what's new need a version in Prepare for Submission; promotional text is editable on the live version. Play fields are always editable.","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"},{"name":"app","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"locale","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","default":"en-US"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The listing.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Listing"}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"502":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/ProviderError"}}}},"/connections/{id}/ads":{"get":{"operationId":"getConnectionAds","tags":["Connections"],"summary":"Read Apple Ads campaigns, ad groups, keywords (with bids), negatives, or a performance report.","description":"`view=campaigns` → `ad_groups` (campaign_id) → `keywords` (campaign_id, ad_group_id) gives the ids the ads.*\nactions take. `view=report&level=keywords|searchterms|adgroups|campaigns&campaign_id=` returns impressions,\ntaps, installs, spend, avg CPT / CPA for `start`..`end` (default the last 7 days, UTC).\n","x-credits":1,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ConnectionId"},{"name":"view","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["campaigns","ad_groups","keywords","negatives","report"],"default":"campaigns"}},{"name":"campaign_id","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"ad_group_id","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"level","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["campaigns","adgroups","keywords","searchterms"]}},{"name":"start","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},{"name":"end","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":1000,"default":200}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The requested view.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"502":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/ProviderError"}}}},"/actions":{"get":{"operationId":"listActions","tags":["Actions"],"summary":"List proposed and applied actions (drafts, pending approval, applied, failed, rejected), newest first.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"status","in":"query","description":"Comma list: draft, pending_approval, approved, applied, failed, rejected.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"type","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ActionType"}},{"name":"connection","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Limit100"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"One page of actions.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Action"}}}}]}}}}}},"post":{"operationId":"createAction","tags":["Actions"],"summary":"Propose a write to a connected account (reply to a review, update a listing, set keywords, upload screenshots, change Apple Ads bids / keywords / negatives); always start with dry_run=true.","description":"Computes the before → after `diff` from the live account and runs guardrails (policy / tone / claims\nprobabilities for text, plus deterministic checks like character limits and bid jumps). Free.\n- `dry_run: true` → a `draft` (24 h) with the diff: show it to the user. To go ahead, call\n  `POST /v1/actions/{id}/approve`.\n- otherwise → `pending_approval` (a person approves it in the dashboard, link in `approve_url`), or `applied`\n  immediately when the org has an auto-apply rule for this type that the guardrail score clears (Studio,\n  1 credit).\nBlocking check failures (over a character limit, nothing to change, not editable) return 400 with `checks`\n(a dry run returns them in `guardrail.checks_failed` instead).\n\nParams per type (`app` = a linked App Store id or package name, `locale` like en-US):\n- `review.reply` (asc, play_console): `{ app, review_id, text }` — review ids from GET /v1/connections/{id}/reviews. Play replies ≤ 350 chars.\n- `listing.update` (asc, play_console): `{ app, locale, fields: { name|title, subtitle, description, promotional_text, whats_new, marketing_url, support_url, privacy_policy_url } }` (Play: title, short_description, full_description, video).\n- `keywords.set` (asc): `{ app, locale, keywords: [..] | \"a,b,c\", mode?: replace|add|remove }` — 100 bytes comma-joined.\n- `screenshots.upload` (asc, play_console): `{ app, locale, display_type: APP_IPHONE_67 … (asc) | image_type: phoneScreenshots … (play), images: [{ url }], replace?: true }`.\n- `ads.keyword.bid` (apple_ads): `{ campaign_id, ad_group_id, keywords: [{ id, bid?, status?: ENABLED|PAUSED }], max_increase?: 1 }`.\n- `ads.keyword.add` (apple_ads): `{ campaign_id, ad_group_id, keywords: [{ text, match_type?: EXACT|BROAD, bid? }] }`.\n- `ads.negative.add` (apple_ads): `{ campaign_id, ad_group_id?, keywords: [{ text, match_type? }] }`.\n","x-credits":"0 (dry run, pending approval) or 1 when auto-applied","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["type","params"],"properties":{"type":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ActionType"},"connection":{"type":"string","description":"Connection id; optional when exactly one active connection fits the type (and params.app)."},"params":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"dry_run":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"source":{"type":"string","description":"Who proposes it: api, mcp or playbook:<name> (shown in the approvals list)."}}},"example":{"type":"review.reply","dry_run":true,"source":"playbook:reply-to-every-review","params":{"app":"1234567890","review_id":"00000043-a2fa-4f01-0000-000000000000","text":"Thanks for the detailed report! Version 2.4.1 fixes the login loop."}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"The action (draft, pending_approval or applied).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Action"}}}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InvalidParam"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Conflict"},"502":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/ProviderError"}}}},"/actions/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"getAction","tags":["Actions"],"summary":"Get one action with its diff, guardrail scores, status, result or error, and audit trail.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ActionId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The action.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Action"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/actions/{id}/approve":{"post":{"operationId":"approveAction","tags":["Actions"],"summary":"Go ahead with a draft or pending action; applies it when a person approves (or a rule allows), else submits it for approval.","description":"From an API key / agent: a `draft` becomes `pending_approval` (a person approves at `approve_url`) unless an\nauto-apply rule clears it, in which case it is applied. A `pending_approval` action needs a person unless the\norg enabled agent approval (403 otherwise). From the dashboard: applies it. The diff is recomputed before\napplying; 409 conflict when the account changed since the dry run (`force: true` applies the new diff).\nThe result is `applied` (1 credit) or `failed` with `error` (free).\n","x-credits":"1 when applied, else 0","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ActionId"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"force":{"type":"boolean","default":false}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The action after approval (pending_approval, applied or failed).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Action"}}}]}}}},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Conflict"}}}},"/actions/{id}/reject":{"post":{"operationId":"rejectAction","tags":["Actions"],"summary":"Discard a draft or pending action (nothing is written to the account).","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ActionId"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"reason":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Rejected.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Action"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Conflict"}}}},"/jobs/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"getJob","tags":["Jobs"],"summary":"Poll a background store fetch started by a read that answered refreshing:true (free).","description":"Poll every few seconds until `status` is done / partial / failed, then repeat the original call.","x-credits":0,"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"description":"`meta.freshness.job_id`, e.g. `fetch_123`.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The job.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"},{"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}}}]}}}},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"}}}},"/openapi.json":{"get":{"operationId":"getOpenapi","tags":["Account"],"summary":"This OpenAPI 3.1 document (no key needed, free).","security":[],"x-credits":0,"responses":{"200":{"description":"The spec.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/me":{"get":{"operationId":"getMe","tags":["Account"],"summary":"Your plan, credits left this cycle and limits.","x-credits":0,"x-served-by":"gateway","responses":{"200":{"description":"The account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}}},"webhooks":{"event":{"post":{"operationId":"receiveEvent","summary":"What AppGoat POSTs to your `kind: webhook` endpoint for every event (and for test sends, type `test`).","description":"Verify `appgoat-signature: t=<unix seconds>,v1=<hex>` before trusting the body: compute\nHMAC-SHA256(secret, `<t>.<raw request body>`), compare in constant time, and reject timestamps older than\n5 minutes. Deduplicate on `appgoat-event-id` (a retry repeats it). Answer 2xx within 10 seconds; do the\nwork asynchronously.\n","parameters":[{"name":"appgoat-signature","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"t=1792650000,v1=5257a869e7ecebeda32affa62cdca3fa51cad7e77a0e56ff536d0ce8e108d8bd"}},{"name":"appgoat-event-id","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"appgoat-event-type","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"appgoat-delivery-id","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Event"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Any 2xx acknowledges the delivery; anything else (or a timeout) is retried."}}}}},"components":{"securitySchemes":{"apiKey":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"x-api-key","description":"Create a key at https://dash.appgoat.ai."}},"parameters":{"App":{"name":"app","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Any app identifier: App Store id (`284882215`, `id284882215`), Play package (`com.spotify.music`), Apple bundle id (`com.spotify.client`), store URL (URL-encoded), `apple:<id>` / `play:<id>`, or a name (`spotify`).","schema":{"type":"string","example":"com.spotify.music"}},"StoreHint":{"name":"store","in":"query","description":"Disambiguates `{app}` (a bundle id vs a Play package, or a name).","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"}},"Country":{"name":"country","in":"query","description":"ISO country code(s): `us` (default), a comma list (paid plans), or `all` (Studio).","schema":{"type":"string","default":"us","example":"us,de"}},"MaxAgeApp":{"name":"max_age","in":"query","description":"Refresh from the store when our data is older than this many seconds (0 = always). Default 604800 (7 days).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"default":604800}},"MaxAgeReviews":{"name":"max_age","in":"query","description":"Refresh the latest US reviews when older than this many seconds. Default 86400 (1 day).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"default":86400}},"Wait":{"name":"wait","in":"query","description":"Block up to ~25 s for a refresh (default). false = answer immediately from cache with a job id.","schema":{"type":"boolean","default":true}},"Since":{"name":"since","in":"query","description":"Only items at or after this ISO date / datetime.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","example":"2026-10-01"}},"Limit100":{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":50}},"Cursor":{"name":"cursor","in":"query","description":"`meta.next_cursor` from the previous page.","schema":{"type":"string"}},"Fields":{"name":"fields","in":"query","description":"Comma list of top-level fields to return (identifiers are always kept), e.g. `title,rating,version`.","schema":{"type":"string"}},"ConnectionId":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Connection id (`con_…`).","schema":{"type":"string"}},"ActionId":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Action id (`act_…`).","schema":{"type":"string"}},"TrackedKeywordId":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer"}},"WatchId":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer"}},"WebhookId":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer"}}},"responses":{"Fetching":{"description":"Not in the catalog yet and still being fetched; poll `GET /v1/jobs/{meta.freshness.job_id}` and call again.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Envelope"}}}},"InvalidParam":{"description":"A parameter is missing or invalid (`error.param` names it).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":{"code":"invalid_param","message":"limit must be ≤ 100","hint":"Fix the parameter and retry.","docs":"https://docs.appgoat.ai/errors/invalid_param","param":"limit"}}}}},"PaymentRequired":{"description":"`insufficient_credits` (the call costs more than you have left; nothing was done) or `plan_limit` (a feature of a higher plan).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"AppNotFound":{"description":"Nothing matches `{app}`, or the store does not have it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"InvalidCredentials":{"description":"The provider rejected the credentials, or a field is missing; `hint` says where to find / fix it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"ProviderError":{"description":"App Store Connect / Google Play / Apple Ads answered with an error (message passed through).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"Conflict":{"description":"The state does not allow this (already applied, expired, connection read-only or invalid, account changed since the dry run).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"Forbidden":{"description":"Needs a person (approve in the dashboard at `error.approve_url`).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"NotFound":{"description":"Not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}},"schemas":{"Provider":{"type":"string","enum":["asc","play_console","apple_ads"],"description":"asc = App Store Connect, play_console = Google Play Console, apple_ads = Apple Ads (Search Ads)."},"LinkedApp":{"type":"object","properties":{"store":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"},"app_id":{"type":"string"},"external_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"title":{"type":["string","null"]},"bundle_id":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"Connection":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","example":"con_x8Hq2mXc0aLpQwRtYb"},"provider":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Provider"},"label":{"type":"string"},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["actions","read_only"]},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","invalid","deleted"]},"account":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"description":"Non-secret identifiers (issuer_id, key_id, client_email, ad_account_id, ad_account_name, currency, …)."},"apps":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LinkedApp"}},"last_verified_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"last_error":{"type":["string","null"]},"last_synced_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"Last downloads / proceeds sync (ASC with vendor_number","Play with reports_bucket).":null},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"available_apps":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LinkedApp"},"description":"Only on verify."}}},"ActionType":{"type":"string","enum":["review.reply","listing.update","keywords.set","screenshots.upload","ads.keyword.bid","ads.keyword.add","ads.negative.add"]},"Diff":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"description":"What changes: app, locale, review (rating, text), campaign / ad group …"},"changes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"before":{},"after":{}}}},"summary":{"type":"string"},"notes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}},"Guardrail":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["passed","flagged","unavailable","not_applicable"]},"score":{"type":"number","description":"Lowest AI check probability (1 when none apply). Auto-apply rules compare this."},"checks":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"number"},"description":"Probability each holds: policy (store rules), tone (professional), claims (no risky promises), relevance (replies)."},"warnings":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"checks_failed":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"severity":{"type":"string","enum":["block","warn"]},"message":{"type":"string"}}}},"model":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"Action":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","example":"act_Qm3xXk2Lw9PaZr0cVb"},"type":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ActionType"},"connection_id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["draft","pending_approval","approved","applied","failed","rejected"]},"params":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"diff":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Diff"},"guardrail":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Guardrail"},"result":{"description":"What the provider returned when applied."},"error":{"type":["string","null"]},"created_by":{"type":"string","description":"api, mcp, playbook:<name> or dashboard."},"approved_by":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"user:<id>, auto (rule) or api."},"rejected_reason":{"type":["string","null"]},"credits":{"type":"integer"},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"applied_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"expires_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"approve_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Dashboard page where a person approves it."},"audit":{"type":"array","description":"Only on GET /actions/{id}.","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"event":{"type":"string"},"actor":{"type":"string"},"at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"detail":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":true}}}}}},"ProviderReview":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The provider's review id (use in review.reply)."},"rating":{"type":["integer","null"]},"title":{"type":["string","null"]},"body":{"type":["string","null"]},"author":{"type":["string","null"]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]},"language":{"type":["string","null"]},"version":{"type":["string","null"]},"created_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"response":{"type":["object","null"],"properties":{"id":{"type":["string","null"]},"body":{"type":"string"},"updated_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"state":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ASC: PENDING_PUBLISH or PUBLISHED."}}}}},"Listing":{"type":"object","properties":{"app":{"type":"string"},"locale":{"type":"string"},"fields":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":["string","null"]}},"editable":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"notes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"version":{"type":["string","null"]},"version_state":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"Store":{"type":"string","enum":["apple","play"]},"Freshness":{"type":"object","properties":{"fetched_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"When the oldest requested country was last fetched from the store."},"age_seconds":{"type":["integer","null"]},"stale":{"type":"boolean","description":"Older than max_age (or missing)."},"refreshing":{"type":"boolean","description":"A store fetch is still running; poll job_id."},"job_id":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"Meta":{"type":"object","properties":{"credits_used":{"type":"integer"},"credits_remaining":{"type":"integer","description":"Added by the gateway."},"request_id":{"type":"string","description":"Added by the gateway."},"freshness":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Freshness"},"next_cursor":{"type":["string","null"]},"store":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Store"},"warnings":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Things to know (e.g. \"resolved by name\"); safe to show to the user."}}},"Envelope":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"}}},"Error":{"type":"object","required":["error"],"properties":{